sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor B as Buyer's app
    participant API as push.routes
    participant O as orders.on_order_status_changed
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant W as apps/worker (push_queue)
    participant S as apps/scheduler
    participant E as exp.host

    B->>API: PUT /push/devices {token, platform} + Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: upsert push_devices by token (moves to this account)
    API-->>B: {id, active}

    Note over O: any status write (fulfilment settle, refund, top-up credit)
    O->>DB: push_messages per active device (same txn, UNIQUE device+kind:order)
    O->>DB: pg_notify push_queue
    DB-->>W: NOTIFY
    alt ENVIRONMENT=prod
        W->>E: POST /push/send (≤100 messages)
        E-->>W: tickets
        W->>DB: sent + ticket_id / retry with backoff / failed (+ disable gone device)
    else
        W->>DB: status=skipped
    end

    S->>E: every 15 min: POST /push/getReceipts (sent ≥15 min ago)
    E-->>S: receipts
    S->>DB: receipt_status; DeviceNotRegistered disables the device

    B->>API: DELETE /push/devices/{id} (before sign-out)
    API->>DB: disabled_at, reason=signed_out
